      "first": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 1,
        "text": "THE VIKING - Terry Jones --------------- Blackness. Flames begin to lick upwards from the bottom of the screen. Suddenly all hell breaks loose. Screaming, yelling. Black figures flash across the foreground, with the flames still burning behind."
      },
